president, did you know that it's actually against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:13.860
the law for Ron DeSantis to run for president&nbsp;
unless he resigns his governorship? There is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:19.620
Florida law that forces governors to resign if&nbsp;
they want to run for president of the United&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:27.240
States. So what is Ron DeSantis going to do?&nbsp;
Well, it's looking like Republicans in Florida are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:33.480
looking at changing that law specifically so that&nbsp;
Ron DeSantis could remain governor while running.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:37.500
Now, you might say. But, David, I remember&nbsp;
that Jeb Bush remember the please clap guy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.880
Jeb Bush was governor and he ran for president.&nbsp;
That's true. But Jeb Bush was not governor at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:51.540
the time that he was running for president. He&nbsp;
had previously been a governor. So let's take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:57.180
a look at an article that explains what's going&nbsp;
on w FSU Public Media reported a couple of months&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:02.220
ago. Florida leaders are considering a change&nbsp;
